stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LocallyAvailable

    LocallyAvailable --> MessageEligible: shared, unseen,<br>and due for transmission

    MessageEligible --> MessageQueued: selected by generateBatch()<br>expiry set, txCount++
    MessageQueued --> MessageSent: MESSAGE written<br>to outgoing stream
    MessageQueued --> SessionFailed: write failed

    MessageSent --> WaitingForAcknowledgement: outgoing stream closed

    WaitingForAcknowledgement --> Acknowledged: ACK received in a later<br>reverse-direction stream
    WaitingForAcknowledgement --> MessageEligible: expiry reached and a new<br>outgoing stream is available
    WaitingForAcknowledgement --> MessageEligible: lower-latency transport used

    MessageEligible --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible
    MessageQueued --> NotEligible: no longer shared<br>before transmission
    WaitingForAcknowledgement --> NotEligible: unshared, deleted,<br>or not visible

    Acknowledged --> [*]
    NotEligible --> [*]
    SessionFailed --> [*]